  description="What Pilot gives an agent marketplace (identity, signed trust handshakes, messaging, Wallet app payments) and what you build yourself: discovery and reputation."
  date="July 11, 2026"
  tags={["marketplace", "discovery", "reputation"]}
  canonicalPath="/blog/build-ai-agent-marketplace-discovery-reputation"
